    "notes": [
      "Draft configuration: The 2016 car-course configuration retains the outer permanent southern return and eastern hairpin, the northern permanent junction bend, Rue Oqba Ben Nafaa, the short connection onto Avenue du 7eme Art, its southern curved return, Boulevard Mohammed VI and the short transverse closing road. The FIA race-preview plan identifies the two joined branches, distinct from the winding karting circuit inside the paddock. The entire supporting route uses exact connected public road nodes from a pinned 2020 snapshot. The independently measured 3047.9 m differs from the supplied 2983 m scalar by 64.9 m and from the FIA 2971 m figure by 76.9 m; no route is scaled or shortened. Temporary barrier placement, corner radii, travel direction and historical racing-line extent remain provisional. The karting course, inner service-road shortcut, pit access and northern hotel-access continuation are excluded. Branch identity was checked against catalogue layout facts and circuit identification references. Independent source distance 3047.9 m; no coordinates are changed to match a diagram or distance. Travel direction and historical alignment remain provisional."
